      "website": "https://vorflux.ai",
      "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA",
      "long_description": "Vorflux is a cloud-based AI coding agent for teams that takes work from an idea, ticket, or message through planning, implementation, review, testing, and a pull request.\r\n\r\nIts harness coordinates parallel agents, uses different models for planning and adversarial review, and retains codebase knowledge across sessions. Each team's repository and full stack run on dedicated compute, where QA agents test the application in a real browser and record video evidence.\r\n\r\nVorflux connects to tools such as GitHub, GitLab, Linear, Slack, Figma, and Jira, as well as cloud infrastructure and observability tools. Teams can bring their own models, with tasks routed to the best-value model. Vorflux also helps teams set up the harness and work through their first backlog.",
      "one_liner": "A cloud-based AI coding agent for teams",
